 "passage": "<p><b>Directions to the Carrill Laboratory</b></p><p>Enter through the main door at 3017 Bowman Street and sign in with the <b>(131)______</b> guard. Take the elevator to the second floor. <b>(132)______</b> , you may use the stairs to the left of the elevator. Once you reach the second floor, turn left <b>(133)______</b> , then continue straight until you reach the double doors. Proceed through the doors and pass the visitors' lounge. <b>(134)______</b> .</p>",
